<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37080" root="كفت" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفْتٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفِيتٌ</span></b>  (and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفِتٌ</span></b> , Ks) A man
<i>quick</i> or <i>swift,</i> (S, K,) <i>and light, active,</i> or <i>agile,
and slender:</i> (K:) so too a horse. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدْوٌ كَفِيتٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفَاتٌ</span></b> , [the latter originally
an inf. n.] <i>A quick,</i> or <i>swift, running:</i> and so
a passing by, or through. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Hence]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفْتٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Death.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُبْزٌ كَفْتٌ</span> <i>Bread without seasoning; without savoury food.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفْتٌ</span>.

